{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《夫妻的博弈》話題不斷，劇中飾演千金小姐的游嘉欣（游游），與馬國明飾演兩兄妹，兩人互動擦出不少火花備受觀眾關注！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"26edc9a7-3523-409a-8bfa-d162499f0484.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026JH8TnK5xcS1786689767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"26edc9a7-3523-409a-8bfa-d162499f0484.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了幕前亮眼的演出，游游的外貌變化近期亦成為網民的熱烈討論焦點。日前，有網民在社交平台上載了一張游游不同階段及近年的照片作對比，並發文提出疑問：「個樣靚咗，但又睇唔出佢整咗咩位，係減肥成功定整咗容？」帖文一出，瞬間惹來大批網民熱議。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"32f28cb8-5a81-40dc-a12f-5930d121044b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026bACQToWFp61786689767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"32f28cb8-5a81-40dc-a12f-5930d121044b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對整容傳聞，性格直率的游游並沒有迴避，反而大方在帖文下親自回覆：「係大個咗，無曬Baby Fat，知道點樣打扮先適合自己🤭。」她更幽默地大派定心丸：「放心，如果整咗容，一定同大家分享，而家距離『整容級美貌』仲差一大段路！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"47329cfc-701a-4966-b885-ce9c628433ef.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026U8MVugxKG91786689767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"47329cfc-701a-4966-b885-ce9c628433ef.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f86133c0-4027-45b1-a1da-4eca967edcf4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20265C3IzTMx8r1786689767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f86133c0-4027-45b1-a1da-4eca967edcf4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a3d698a4-dd29-4aea-8ef9-37bcf7fd4025.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Wk7xE30PZd1786689767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a3d698a4-dd29-4aea-8ef9-37bcf7fd4025.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了澄清沒有動刀，游游更毫不吝嗇地分享自己的「瘦面神技」。她坦白承認自己曾做過 HIFU療程：「Hifu都確實係有助改善包包面，有需要可以參考吓！」不少網民都激讚她夠貼地又坦白，並認同減肥和找對打扮風格的確能令人脫胎換骨！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T09:02:34.588355+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":398,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}